---
import Card__Structure from "./molecules/card__structure.astro";
import icon2 from "../assets/Icons/icon_2.svg";

---

<section
    id="structure"
    class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-full lg:py-24 w-full pt-8 pb-10 gap-6 lg:gap-24 bg-black-900"
>
    <article
        class="w-full h-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4"
    >
        <h2
            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-white-700 uppercase font-bebas-neue leading-tight lg:leading-14 mt-2 text-left lg:text-center w-full"
        >
            Operational Structure & 

            <span class="text-accent">Financial Integrity Framework</span>
        </h2>
        <p
            class="text-gray-300 lg:mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-left lg:text-center w-full lg:w-2/3"
        >
            WiseGold Capital operates through a transparent, non-custodial model where client funds are routed via approved counterparties, while financing is offered through independent entities without assuming lender risk. This structure eliminates balance sheet exposure and discretionary control, ensuring operational integrity and clear asset separation.
        </p>
    </article>
    <article
        id="model-cards"
        class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-end px-4 justify-center gap-4 "
    >
        <Card__Structure
            icon={icon2.src}
            title="Structured and Transparent"
            description="This structure reinforces transparency and operational discipline across all flows."
            item1="Client funds routed via approved intermediaries"
            item2="WiseGold Capital does not hold client funds"
            item3="Payments sent to suppliers, custody and logistics"
            item4="Designed for control, clarity and customization"
        />
        <Card__Structure
            icon={icon2.src}
            title="Collateralized Financing "
            description="Designed to provide liquidity while maintaining underlying bullion exposure."
            item1="Financing via independent counterparties only"
            item2="WiseGold Capital coordinates and reports activity"
            item3="Does not act or operate as a lending entity"
            item4="Client balances remain fully segregated"
        />
        <Card__Structure
            icon={icon2.src}
            title="A Distinct Infrastructure Model"
            description="The platform is built to deliver structure, transparency, and operational integrity."
            item1="No deposit structure within platform design"
            item2="No exposure to client assets on balance sheet"
            item3="No rehypothecation by WiseGold Capital"
            item4="No control over client holdings or allocation"
        />
    </article>
</section>

